Gradient Norm  & 0.65 & 0.78 & 0.85 & 0.90 & 0.95 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{table}

Table~\ref{tab:threshold} provides operating point analysis for stable rank at 5\% progress. A 15\% deviation threshold achieves 95\% sensitivity and 92\% specificity (F1=0.93), offering a practical recipe: \emph{compute stable rank every 50 steps; if deviation from baseline exceeds 15\%, flag for intervention}. The computational overhead is negligible---stable rank is a byproduct of existing weight matrix operations.

\begin{table}[t]
