\subsection{Self-Recovery Phenomenon}
\label{sec:recovery}

An unexpected finding emerges at moderate contamination levels: \emph{partial self-recovery}. At 50\% contamination, perplexity peaks at generation~2 (20.5) then decreases to 19.2 by generation~4, a 6.3\% improvement. Token entropy shows a corresponding 8\% rebound. This pattern is reproduced across all 3 seeds. At 25\% contamination, the recovery is stronger, with near-baseline PPL by generation~4 (15.8 vs.\ 13.5 baseline). At 75\% contamination, no recovery is observed---degradation is continuous.

